    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33299" root="فذ" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ القَوْمُ فُذَاذَ</span></b> , (O,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُذَاذًا</span></b> , (Msb,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُذَّاذًا</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْذَاذًا</span></b> , <i>The people,</i> or <i>party, came
one by one; singly.</i> (O, Msb.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَلْنَا فُذَاذَى</span>,
(K, TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَذَاذَى</span>, (CK,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُذَاذًا</span></b> , and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُذَّاذًا</span></b> , <i>We ate separately.</i> (K.)

